  (text "Commander keyboard - the microcontroller circuit, soldered straight onto the keyboard PCB in place of the Arduino\nMicro module (U1 of the Altium design).\n\nSince 2026-11-19 (user's request: QMK / VIA): a Raspberry Pi RP2040 (LCSC C2040) with its QSPI flash, 12 MHz crystal\nand a 3.3 V LDO, instead of the STC8H8K64U of 2026-11-15 (which needed a firmware of its own).  QMK runs on the\nRP2040 as it is, VIA with it; firmware goes in as a UF2 file over the USB-C: hold BOOTSEL while plugging the cable in\n(or QMK's bootloader key / double tap of reset), the board shows up as a USB drive.  The QMK keyboard definition is\nin ../../firmware/qmk/ (pin table below).\n\n3.3 V: the RP2040's pins take NO 5 V.  The matrix (from the prototype) ran on 5 V; what changes for it:\n- the 16 column pull-ups (R169-R184) hang on VCC3V3 instead of VCC5 (OVERRIDE below; on the board their supply\ntrack is cut off the 5 V bus and fed from the LDO)\n- the rows are driven 0 / 3.3 V; the phototransistors' collectors (columns) then stay at or under 3.3 V\n- the infra-red LEDs keep their 5 V (560 ohm from VCC5 to LED_K, switched by Q1); R185, Q1's base resistor, is 330\nohm instead of 1 k so that a 3.3 V output still drives Q1 hard (about 7 mA base current for 0.56 A)\n- T16's LED hangs between 5 V (560 ohm) and row A0: with A0 high (3.3 V) about 1 mA flows back into that pin, which\nthe chip's own 3.3 V consumption takes; it is never above 3.3 V\nKept: USB-C (device side, 5.1 k on both CC pins), the ESD array, the series resistors (27 ohm now, the RP2040's\nvalue), the resettable fuse (750 mA: the 84 infra-red LEDs draw about 0.56 A when all are on).\nNet names are still the ARDUINO pin names (D0..D13, A0..A5, MISO / SCK / MOSI) the prototype used: they name the\nmatrix lines, not chip pins any more.  References are in a 200-block (no collision with the Altium parts).\nThe matrix on the RP2040's 3.3 V (2026-11-19, see 01_kbd_mcu.net): changes to parts the Altium design's generated\nfiles (02-08) declare." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top)) (uuid "68d19a95-0ac6-5e21-bc30-79127dcede06"))
